{"id":"e244e427679f34a1","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-space-time-relations.md","title":"Relations Between Space and Time","display":"thm-space-time-relations — Relations Between Space and Time","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-space-time-relations","aliases":["28-thm-space-time-relations"],"display":"thm-space-time-relations — Relations Between Space and Time","depends_on":["[[28-df-dtime]]","[[28-df-dspace]]","[[28-df-nspace]]","[[28-df-space-constructible]]","[[28-df-l]]","[[28-df-nl]]","[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-pspace]]","[[28-df-exp]]","[[28-df-configuration-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-space-time-relations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-space-time-relations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-space-time-relations — Relations Between Space and Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"af1247ecca733ff0\" href=\"?note=af1247ecca733ff0\" title=\"28-df-space-constructible\">28-df-space-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5e2f71764c556aa9\" href=\"?note=5e2f71764c556aa9\" title=\"28-df-exp\">28-df-exp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" href=\"?note=1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" title=\"28-df-configuration-graph\">28-df-configuration-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{NSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{NSPACE}\\)</span> 分别见本目录时间及空间类定义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为空间可构造函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>所有资源类采用固定多带模型及常数因子约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\n\\subseteq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c\\,s(n)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DTIME}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\n\\subseteq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c\\,s(n)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\\subseteq\\mathbf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathbf P\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathbf{EXP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf L\\subseteq\\mathbf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathbf P\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathbf{EXP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每一步只访问常数个工作格给出时间到空间包含；确定型为非确定型特例。空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span> 的配置数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{O(s(n))}\">\\(2^{O(s(n))}\\)</span>，显式遍历配置图可在该指数时间内决定接受性。NP 可逐个枚举多项式长度证据并复用空间；对数空间的配置图只有多项式大小。各包含本身不声称严格，严格性另由层级定理推出。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理4.2及§4.3末总结；印刷80–81、92页；PDF106–107、118页。配置枚举证明结构已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-space-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"af1247ecca733ff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-space-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-l]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-exp","status":"resolved","id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-exp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-graph","status":"resolved","id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-graph]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTIME}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\n\\subseteq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c\\,s(n)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf L\\subseteq\\mathbf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathbf P\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathbf{EXP}.","display":true},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"2^{O(s(n))}","display":false}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计算模型与空间归约接口：[[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]、[[28-df-pspace-complete]]、[[28-thm-space-time